    <!-- Release L (VAULT-MESSAGING 0.29.0 §3.6.8): the idle lock, on Security. As ANDROID-PLAN §4 "Locking the vault" part 2 (approved by the owner 2026-10-24); %1$s the time past the deadline ("7 days"). -->
